# CQRS Slice

See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) New Feature — 7 Steps.

- Command/query, handler, validator, DTO in the same feature folder
- No `Mapping/`, `Dtos/`, or `Validators/` subfolders
- Feature mapper at feature root (for example `ProductMapper.cs`)
- Endpoints: `TypedResults` only — never `IResult`
- Declare `Produces<T>` and `ProducesProblem` on every endpoint
- Void commands: `ICommand`; with response: `ICommand<TResponse>` — not `ICommand<Unit>`
